        <mxCell id="3" parent="2" vertex="1" value="(a) Architecture Profile&lt;br/&gt;Topology and deployment constraints&lt;br/&gt;64 → 128 → 256 → 128 → 64&lt;br/&gt;Feature widths&lt;br/&gt;DWPW depth&lt;br/&gt;3 / 4 / (12+2) / 4 / 3 = 28&lt;br/&gt;MBD placement&lt;br/&gt;E1 ×1 · Bottleneck ×2 · D1 ×1&lt;br/&gt;LRC placement&lt;br/&gt;Bottleneck ×1 at H/4 resolution&lt;br/&gt;RGB image only&lt;br/&gt;Inference input&lt;br/&gt;Full-resolution path&lt;br/&gt;Generic restoration; no MBD&lt;br/&gt;Replicate-pad to ×4; crop output&lt;br/&gt;Boundary handling&lt;br/&gt;13.70 M&lt;br/&gt;Parameters" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=width;shape=mxgraph.basic.polygon;polyCoords=[[0.02,0],[0.98,0],[1,0.04],[1,0.96],[0.98,1],[0.02,1],[0,0.96],[0,0.04],[0.02,0]];fillColor=#EADFF4;fillOpacity=52;strokeColor=#8D6BAB;strokeWidth=1.7;strokeOpacity=52;dashed=1;dashPattern=10.2 8.5;fontSize=19;fontColor=#25313C;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;spacing=2;"><mxGeometry x="18" y="64.8" width="547.2" height="316.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
